          <p>When I joined Ascentic’s AI Launchpad, my dad suggested agriculture. Research narrowed that big subject to one question: could a farmer use a phone to identify a possible plant problem and find a useful next step, even with limited connectivity? CropCare is my answer so far, and this is the talk where I presented it.</p>
        </header>
        <div class="cc-talk-grid">
